/// Spawns the object described by the `daYoshiEgg_c` spawn record.
///
/// Reads the spawn word through the pointer at `actor + 0x3E8`. When the top
/// nibble of that word is 2 it copies the incoming position, subtracts the
/// shared `Y` offset at `0x807D0550`, and calls `0x80064680` with id `0x26B`.
/// Otherwise it calls `0x80064680` with id `0x209` and, when an object is
/// returned, copies `actor + 0x404` to the new object's `+0x804`.
///
/// # Original
/// `FUN_807A5830`, `0x807A5830`, 164 bytes,
/// `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/807a5830_FUN_807a5830.c`.
/// Synthetic base `0x80600000`; not a runtime address.
