/// May create one actor and write its `+0x804` field.
///
/// # Safety
/// `actor`, the spawn record pointer at `+0x3E8`, and `position` must be
/// readable; `0x80064680` must be callable.
///
/// # Confidence
/// medium - control flow, ids and offsets are explicit; the `(float)` cast in
/// the C is a Ghidra type-recovery artifact for the float word at
/// `position + 4`, and the spawn-word category is inferred from the nibble
/// test.
