/// Advances the `daYoshiEgg_c` input/release state machine.
///
/// The word at `+0x410` selects which bit of the `0x8006A220` result is
/// tested: state 0 -> bit 0, state 1 -> bit 1, state 2 -> bit 2, state 3 ->
/// bit 3, state 4 -> bit 4. On a match it calls the corresponding
/// `0x800B51C0`, `0x800B51F0`, `0x800B5220` or `0x800B5250` helper and
/// advances the state.
///
