/// Advances the `daYoshiEgg_c` rotation and counts completed turns.
///
/// Adds the angular step at `+0xEC` to the accumulator at `+0x3F0`. When the
/// accumulator reaches the full-turn constant at `0x807D0540`, it wraps by
/// subtracting that constant, calls the untranslated spawn-record tick
/// `0x807A58E0` with `actor`, increments the turn counter at `+0x404`, and
/// dispatches state `0x808332E0` once the target at `+0x400` is reached.
///
/// # Original
/// `FUN_807A5BC0`, `0x807A5BC0`, 140 bytes,
/// `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/807a5bc0_FUN_807a5bc0.c`.
/// Synthetic base `0x80600000`; not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `actor` - live `daYoshiEgg_c` object.
