/// Calls a target with one `f32` and one `u32` argument.
///
/// # Original
/// Host-side ABI wrapper for `0x80168FE0` and `0x801680E0`, whose C prototypes
/// are hidden by the missing debug types and print `(double)` for a value the
/// instruction stream loads with `lfs`.
