/// Advances the `characterChangeIndicator` lamp animation.
///
/// The routine compares the applied state at `+0x248` with the requested state
/// at `+0x24C`. When they match it only re-checks the player object and, if the
/// indicator is idle, stops the animation and clears `+0x23A`/`+0x23C`.
/// Otherwise it starts the requested animation on the two handles at `+0x224`
/// and `+0x228`, updates the layout, and selects the `0x0A`/`0x0D` animation
