/// Runs `0x80066FC0`, writes vtable `0x807F5E80`, initialises the accessor at
/// `+0x3D0`, clears `+0x3EC` and `+0x530`, and creates six arrays:
/// 5 x `0x40` at `+0x3F0`, 120 x `0xC` at `+0x540`, 5 x `0xA4` at `+0xCD4`,
/// 4 x `0x114` at `+0x104C`, 4 x `0xC` at `+0x14AC` and 2 x `0x128` at
/// `+0x14DC`.
