/// Initialises the magic-attack countdown, direction and sound.
///
/// # Original
/// `FUN_806b9930`, `0x806b9930`, 236 bytes,
/// `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/806b9930_FUN_806b9930.c`.
