/// Resets the animation state at `+0x148`, stores the random direction from
/// [`fn_806b9740`] and the angle from `0x806B9800`, corrects the angle for the
/// local player's variant byte, stores the tick count from `0x80C3DFD0`, and
/// queues sound `0x51D`.
///
