/// Advances the lift's hover offset and settles it when the timer expires.
///
/// # Original
/// `FUN_806CA300`, `0x806CA300`, 236 bytes,
/// `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/806ca300_FUN_806ca300.c`.
/// `// synthetic base: 0x80600000` (analysis address, not a runtime address).
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `actor` - lift actor; timer `+0x580`, hover origin `+0x584..+0x58C`,
///   current position `+0xAC..+0xB4`.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
