/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80702520` at `0x80702520` (148 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80702520_FUN_80702520.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `record` - two-byte player record: sound-on flag, held-frame counter.
/// * `player` - player index this record belongs to.
/// * `selected` - currently selected player index.
/// * `enabled` - mask bit; 0 forbids starting the sound.
/// * `trigger` - non-zero while the selection is being confirmed.
