/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80610320_FUN_80610320.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `screen` - `dDateFile_c` screen; text objects `+0xDF8`/`+0xDFC` and
///   `+0xE00`/`+0xE04`, pane pointers `+0xE18..+0xE28`.
/// * `pad` - controller input object passed to `0x800CE350`/`0x800CE0B0`.
