/// Drives the `manjirou` lift through its start and drop states.
///
/// State `1` integrates the stored velocity at `+0x6F4..+0x6FC` into the
/// position, steps the actor physics and counts `+0x728` down; when it reaches
/// zero the state becomes `2` and the button word `+0x744` is cleared. State `2`
/// keeps stepping the physics and posts event `0x8082E8F0` on the frame the lift
/// crosses height `0`.
///
/// # Original
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_806f1340` at `0x806F1340` (268 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/806f1340_FUN_806f1340.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `actor`: live `manjirou` object; state `+0x360`, position `+0xE8`,
///   velocity `+0x6F4`, interface `+0x394`.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Accumulates the position, calls the physics steps `0x8006CD40`/`0x8006CDE0`,
/// zeroes 12 bytes at `+0x100` and may post the drop event.
///
/// # Safety
/// `actor` must be live and the interface at `+0x394` must have a vtable.
///
/// # Confidence
