/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/807405a0_FUN_807405a0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `actor`: marker actor; stepper `+0x43C`, previous sign `+0x43E`,
///   direction word `+0x442`, rate limits `+0x440`/`+0x444`, clamp `+0x44A`.
///
