/// # Safety
/// `actor` must be live.
///
/// # Confidence
/// medium - the fast path, the counting loop and the eight-try cap are
/// literal; `0x802DCD74`/`0x802DCDC0` are the compiler save/restore fragments
/// described in the module header, and the range of `0x800B2EE0(4)` is
/// `// inferred:` to stay below 4.
