/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80683b80_FUN_80683b80.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `actor` - live board actor; effect objects at `+0x678` and `+0x78C`,
///   position `+0xAC`.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Calls each effect's virtual `+0xB0` with `(this, position, 0, 0)`.
///
/// # Safety
/// Both effect objects must be live with a valid vtable.
