/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80728fe0_FUN_80728fe0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `actor` - actor to inspect, or zero.
/// * `mask` - bits already collected.
