/// Runs the ship actor's six-state approach machine (`+0x478`).
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_807702a0` at `0x807702a0` (892 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/807702a0_FUN_807702a0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
