/// [`fn_8075df70`], then spawns through `0x800F69F0` using the per-variant
/// record at `0x808147E0` (0x2C-byte stride: two s16 counts, four floats). The
/// second and third float are swapped when the actor sits below its own
/// reference height. Ends by clearing `+0x3B0` and reloading `+0x39C` from
/// `0x808147BE`.
