/// through `0x80103390` / `0x80105240`, grows `+0x3B0` by `0x808147BA` clamped
/// to `0x8000`, decrements `+0x39C` (re-bubbling through [`fn_8075e430`] when
/// it reaches zero) and finally runs [`fn_8075e010`].
