///   `_restgpr_27` epilogue call (`0x802DCDC0`). The prologue `bl` returns no
///   value; `mr r27,r3` right after it is the actor (and is the `r3` of the
///   following `0x8070BCE0` call), and the epilogue `bl` passes nothing.
///
