/// Starts the 60-frame launch: one-shot sound, timer and scaled velocity.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8068AB60` at `0x8068ab60` (196 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/8068ab60_FUN_8068ab60.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `actor` - the `0xDA8`-byte actor; base velocity `+0xDC..+0xE4`, result
///   `+0x544..+0x54C`, timer `+0x550`.
