/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Plays sound `0x270`, stores the frame count `0x3C` at `+0x550`, writes the
/// velocity divided by 60 to `+0x544..+0x54C`, then calls the truncated state
/// helper at `0x8068AB10`.
