///
/// # Arguments
/// * `value` - angle applied to every pane, truncated to a signed halfword.
/// * `screen` - world-select screen object; pane pointers at `+0x248`, count
///   at `+0x294`.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Stores `value as i16` at `pane + 0x2C6` for each of the `count` panes.
///
/// # Safety
/// Every pointer in `screen + 0x248 .. +0x248 + 4*count` must be a live pane
/// with at least `0x2C8` bytes.
