/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80677390` at `0x80677390` (120 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80677390_FUN_80677390.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `actor` - owner; timer at `+0x630`.
