/// Puts the actor back into its initial clip and volume state.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80677970` at `0x80677970` (144 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80677970_FUN_80677970.c`
