/// # Side effects
/// Writes the `1.0` at `0x807C92F4` into `+0xDC..+0xE4`, the `0.0`/`24.0`/
/// `32.0`/`48.0` words at `0x807C9378..0x807C9384` into `+0x318..+0x324` and
/// `+0xD0..+0xD8`, binds the track block `0x807C9350` with `0x8008C3E0`,
