/// Spawns the `Wm_ka_change_*` effect above the block and plays sound `0x590`.
///
/// The effect position is the actor position plus the record's grid coordinates
/// scaled by `8.0` (`16.0 * 0.5`): `+0x0C` gives the y offset (negated) and
/// `+0x08` the x offset, with `5500.0` (`0x807CCAA0`) added to z. The effect name
