/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80712130` at `0x80712130` (284 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80712130_FUN_80712130.c`
