///   `_restgpr_25` epilogue call (`0x802DCDB8`). The prologue `bl` returns no
///   value; `addi r28,r3,0x504` right after it consumes the incoming owner, and
///   the epilogue `bl` was being passed `mask`, which is simply the `r3` return
///   (`mr r3,r29` directly before it).
