///   (`bl 0x8013AAA0` / `cmpwi r3,0` / `bne` past the bit set, `0x80712194`);
///   that gate was missing from the translated body.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `owner`: the frame's current actor, incoming `r3`.
///
/// # Returns
/// The four-bit player mask.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Four lists are walked; each character index below `4` sets one bit.
///
/// # Safety
/// `owner`, all four records, every list node and every vtable must be live.
