/// (`0x800DF180`), attaches the `CS_W7_Cloud` model to `+0x1A8`, constructs the
/// animated part at `+0x1AC` (`0x8016A3A0`, size `0x20`) and the clip player at
/// `+0x1B8` (`0x801650D0`), sets the byte `+0x1EC` from the pool word
/// `0x807CED98`, and disables the two shadow/visibility flags through
/// `0x801680E0`/`0x80168FE0`.
