/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/807601a0_FUN_807601a0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `lift`: cloud lift; position `+0xAC..+0xB4`, Euler angles
///   `+0x100..+0x104`, matrix `+0x7C`, colour `+0xDC`, part `+0x1AC`.
///
