/// Rebuilds the `+0x7C` matrix with `0x801C0BD0`/`0x8016EF50`, copies it into
/// the part (`0x8016A170`), copies the colour (`0x8016A150`) and enables the
/// draw adapter (`0x8016A1A0`).
///
/// # Safety
/// `lift` must be live and writable at `+0x7C..+0x1AC`.
