/// Highlights the ground sphere under each resolved `group01..` clip.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_807603D0` at `0x807603D0` (260 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/807603d0_FUN_807603d0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `lift`: cloud lift; slot array `+0x1F8 + i * 4`, position record
///   `+0x248..+0x254`. The receiver is hidden behind `0x802DCD70`.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// For every non-negative slot, reads the part's current position
/// ([`crate::engine::dsys::fn_800fc560`]), stores it with the walk constant at
/// `0x807CED30`, resolves
/// the clip object through `0x8023B2A0`, tests it against the collision sphere
/// set `0x800FE040` and sets or clears bit `0x100` of the clip's `+0x14` flags.
///
/// # Safety
/// `lift` must be live; the clip objects must expose flag word `+0x14`.
///
/// # Confidence
/// medium - the loop, the bit operation and the four stores are literal; the
/// identity of `0x800FE040` (sphere overlap test) and of the `0x807CED30` walk
/// constants is inferred from the collision call.
