/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/8069a940_FUN_8069a940.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `actor` - live actor; class vtable `+0x60`, outputs `+0xD78` and `+0xE8`.
/// * `slot` - index into the character table (a player slot).
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One state transition, two scaling stores and one unknown main.dol call.
///
/// # Safety
/// `slot` must be a valid player index and the vtable slot must be a code
/// pointer.
///
/// # Confidence
