/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8069da70` at `0x8069DA70` (136 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/8069da70_FUN_8069da70.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - object whose vtable slot `+0x20` returns its class/instance name.
/// * `name` - `"Class:Name"` C string; the comparison uses the part after `:`.
///
/// # Returns
/// `true` when the trimmed strings are equal.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One virtual call, two `strchr` scans and one `strcmp`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` and `name` must be live; the slot must return a C string.
