/// Counts the riders attached to the actor's `+0x3E0` child list.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_806d3680` at `0x806D3680` (328 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/806d3680_FUN_806d3680.c`
///
/// # Arguments
