/// Walks the child chain (`+0x0C` next, `+0x04` actor) and classifies each child
/// by its `+0x38C` kind byte: kind `1` counts when virtual `+0xE0` of the child
/// vtable returns zero, and then posts animation `0x17` through `0x80056C70`;
/// kind `2` counts unconditionally; kind `3` counts only when
/// `0x8006EF40(child + 0x1EC, 0)` is non-zero, in which case the child's
/// `+0x459` byte receives the `child + 0x24 + actor + 0x774 < 0x807CB5C8` test
/// and `0x800656C0` is called with the actor's slot byte and a flag that is `1`
/// for kinds `0x193`, `0x191` and `0x3C`.
