/// # Safety
/// `actor` and every node of the `+0x3E0` chain must be live.
///
/// # Confidence
/// medium - every offset, constant and call is literal; the export loads
/// `0x807CB5C8` and the sums through the paired-single prologue, so the
/// comparison is written in `f32`, which is the value the `lfs` pair produces.
