///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8066E3A0` at `0x8066E3A0` (212 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/8066e3a0_FUN_8066e3a0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// None.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Walks the `0x69` and `0x68` actor lists with `0x80162D50`, and for each
/// actor whose state word (`+0x408` / `+0x3D4`) is still zero and whose
/// `+0x1EC` query is non-zero, runs `0x80040EC0` (type `0x69`) or `0x80123A00`
/// plus a `+0x3D4 = 1` latch (type `0x68`).
