// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Wave 127: `0x807A` actor head, the shared screen prologue/epilogue and the
// course-setup scene tail (0x807A06B0..0x807AD8C0)
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// The first six bodies are the deferred head of the ground actor whose `+0x60`
// vtable supplies the `+0x68`/`+0xAC`/`+0xB0` state slots: its event dispatch,
// start reset, effect spawn, landing probe, contact setup and model move.
