// The `0x807AA310..0x807AB2D0` run is the shared screen prologue/epilogue used
// by the "Otasuke" hint screens: a display-list reset, the four destructor
// copies of the screen object, the per-player screen copy at `+0xE8`/`+0xDC`,
// the nine-slot message mask, the per-player choice probes and the two
// close-time handlers.
//
// The `0x807ACCA0..0x807AD8C0` run is the course-setup scene: its prologue,
// the four-key "is the course set complete" test, the `0x2CF` resource
// allocation, the plain and `+0x18` release templates, the 10x10 course-table
// capture and the two menu handlers reached through the `+0x74` vtable.

