/// `0x8042A4A8` scene handle; otherwise it switches `+0xD0` on input bits `4`
/// and `8`, or on confirm (`0x900`) sets the owner's `+0x296`/`+0x298` flags
/// and pushes a descriptor. A `0x800B53A0` fallback sets `+0x299`.
