// `0x8073B5C0..0x8073C700` is the `0x468`-byte board actor: its constructor,
// start reset, transform build, rider gate, spawn reset, per-frame camera
// follow, position sound emit, vector setter and model release. Its `+0x394`
// animator and `+0x404` model holder match the block around it.
