// `0x8073F7D0..0x8073FDD0` is the tile board of a separate actor: the four
// `0xC`-byte lane records at `+0x450`, the sixteen `0x20`-byte tiles at
// `+0x480` (through `+0x680`), and the allocate / invalidate / decay /
// occlusion helpers over them. [`fn_8073f8e0`] is the isolated
// `g3d/tarzantsuta.brres` loader that sits in the same address window.

/// Rebuilds the four rotating-arm records of the `0xA08` cannon actor.
