/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80730BE0` at `0x80730BE0` (548 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80730be0_FUN_80730be0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `actor` - the `0xA08` actor; flags `+0x04`, arms `+0x5BC` stride `0xE4`,
///   binder state `+0x4D8`, height `+0xB0`, angle table `+0x9D4`.
