/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes sixteen actor fields, calls the two translated model loaders
/// [`fn_80731550`]/[`fn_80731610`], binds five animation records and switches
/// the `+0x394` animator to descriptor `0x80830C60`.
