/// # Safety
/// `actor` must be the freshly allocated `0xA08` block and the NW4R animation
/// binder must be initialised.
///
/// # Confidence
/// medium - every offset, table address and store is literal; the receive of
/// the `0x802DCD60` save thunk (this is `r3`) and the arm-record roles are
/// inferred from the `0xE4` stride and the `+0x688` store.
