/// Shifts the old lane ids through [`fn_8073f9b0`], then walks the `+0x40C`
/// singly linked list: every live node whose actor reports state `1` at
/// `+0x38C` gets its character id from the actor's vtable slot `+0x6C` and
/// fills `x` (`node + 0x1C`), `y` (`node + 0x24`) and the id from `0x800D2270`.
///
