/// For each lane record whose id (`+0x0A`) changed from `+0x0B`, finds the first
/// free tile, marks it occupied with that lane, places it through
/// `0x800DF860` using the record's `+0x08` and a `+0x40`-biased
/// `record[+0x04] * 128.0` coordinate, and seeds `+0x14`/`+0x18` with
/// `record[0]`.
