/// Steers the rider's turn rate from the slot byte and the player mask.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_806d3c20` at `0x806D3C20` (784 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/806d3c20_FUN_806d3c20.c`
