/// Fits a sphere/arc through three points and writes the resulting positions.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_807813f0` at `0x807813F0` (696 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/807813f0_FUN_807813f0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - owner: instance count `+0x290`, result pointer table `+0x28C`.
/// * `a`, `b`, `c` - three live three-`f32` vectors; `b` is the apex, `a` and
