/// `|angle - 180| >= 10` sign fix are literal. Two notes: only the
/// `u.z*v.x - u.x*v.z` cross component is tested (`0x8078155C`), and the
/// `0x807816B0` call site sets `r7 = i` with no eighth argument (the third
/// vector is dead by then - the counter overwrote `r28` at `0x807815F4`).
