/// Updates the ridden object's facing direction from the rider's local state.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80724cd0` at `0x80724CD0` (596 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80724cd0_FUN_80724cd0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - ridden actor: rider slot `+0x38D`, heading `+0x102`, facing byte
///   `+0x348`, flags `+0x12C`, holder `+0x394`, probe block `+0x1EC`.
///
