///
/// # Side effects
/// Rewrites the heading from the `0x807CD1D0` step table, then either the spin
/// path (bit 0 of `+0x12C`) or the three normal facing probes, each committing
/// `+0x348` and posting `0x80830458`/`0x80830498`/`0x808304D8` through virtual
/// `+0x18`.
