/// `this` must be a live actor and the rider returned by `0x8005F900` must be
/// live with readable `+0xC4..+0xCC` and `+0x1EC`.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the facing flag is `(*(f32*)(rider+0xC4) >= 0.0)` and both commit
/// sites store it through the `cntlzw` chain. The spin path posts `0x80830498`
/// (`r30+216`), not `0x80830458`; the export is authoritative there.
/// `// unknown:` the meaning of the `+0xC4` sign (likely a local X).
