/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Runs virtual `+0x1C` on `+0x544`, `+0x14` on `+0x5C0`, virtual `+0xD4` with
/// `0x8082F670` when it snaps back, and calls `0x8070C6D0`, `0x80170980` and
/// `0x801C14C0`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be a live actor with initialised `+0x544`/`+0x5C0` blocks.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - every guard, store and constant is in the instruction stream.
