/// Advances the two ring buffers of the per-frame trail builder.
///
/// For each pointer in `this+0x680..+0x680+4*(u8)(this+0x7ED)` the body consumes
/// the entry's `+0x14` budget in 8.0 steps, appending the entry's `+0x02` angle
