/// Calls virtual slot `slot` of `obj` with three `f32` and one `u32` argument.
///
/// # Original
/// Host-side helper for the `Wm_mr_` runner family, whose shared animation
/// object at `*(this + 0x128) + 4` is driven through slot `+0x5C` with
/// `f1`/`f2`/`f3` and one integer selector
