///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - actor: probe origin `+0xAC`, player byte `+0x38F`, flag
///   `+0x1040`.
/// * `value` - probe height (arrives in `f1`: `fmr f31,f1`).
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Emits one `0x800929F0` effect, one `0x80078410` sound and one `0x80198FC0`
/// line.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be a live actor and the three singletons `[0x80429EE8]`,
/// `[0x80429DD0]`, `[0x80429D60]` loaded.
