/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80711590` at `0x80711590` (272 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80711590_FUN_80711590.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - actor: x `+0xAC`, gate `+0x694`, vtable `+0x60`.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One `0x807103D0`, one `0x800B2EF0` and at most one virtual message call.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be live, `[0x80805EA0]` must be a valid object and the vtable
/// slot `+0xD4` must be present.
