/// * `transform` - transform object decomposed and recomposed twice.
/// * `model` - model whose named node supplies the gate.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Four calls on `transform` and one on `model`; writes the scale vector and
/// the second transform component.
///
/// # Safety
/// `model`, `transform` and the resolved owner must be live objects.
///
/// # Confidence
/// medium - all 62 words decode and the ladder is literal; only the
/// decompose/recompose split of `0x80241710`/`0x80241AA0` is inherited from the
/// merged sibling [`fn_80722180`], and the component adjusted here is `+4`.
