/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8079ed20` at `0x8079ED20` (168 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/8079ed20_FUN_8079ed20.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - actor: position `+0xAC` passed to the sound call.
/// * `variant` - selects the table (`1` or `2`) and is shifted into `r5`.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One gate call and, when a sound id was found, one five-argument sound call.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be a live actor; the two shipped tables are read-only.
