/// Looks up the object for the character id at `+0x38D`, builds a height from a
/// four-entry `f32` table indexed by `+0x348` plus `0.75 * object->+0xE8`,
/// clears the sub-object word at `+0x134`, then stamps a fixed rotation (three
/// floats), a fixed height, two flag words and a zero counter.
