/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80716590` at `0x80716590` (148 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80716590_FUN_80716590.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - actor: velocity `+0xE8`, position `+0xAC`, timer `+0x7C4`.
