///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - object with `+0xAC`/`+0xB0` offsets, `+0x55C` vertical base,
///   `+0x564`/`+0x566` angles, `+0x554` trigger flag and the `+0x102`/`+0x104`
///   angle halfwords.
