/// Clears one four-byte channel record.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8071bfc0` at `0x8071BFC0` (24 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/8071bfc0_FUN_8071bfc0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
