/// Runs the sixteen-state "Koopa Jr. airship boarding" scripted sequence.
///
/// The state word at `+0x340` selects one of sixteen steps. Every step writes
/// the next state itself; the sequence first frames the camera on the player,
/// then walks the `koopaJr_all_root` helper along the bow (`+0x344`), plays the
/// `-180`/`180` rotations through `0x800F64C0`, and finally releases the helper
/// and returns `1`.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8076da30` at `0x8076DA30` (2,656 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/8076da30_FUN_8076da30.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - sequence actor; `+0x340` state, `+0x350` timer, `+0x354`
///   sub-state, `+0x35C` helper handle, `+0x344..+0x34C` frame target,
///   `+0x220`/`+0x258`/`+0x2C8`/`+0x300` trigger volumes, `+0x280` the
///   angle scale, `+0x60` the class vtable.
///
/// # Returns
/// `1` from the terminal state `0xF`, `0` from every other state.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes the state/timer/position fields, spawns and releases the helper
/// handle, plays sound ids `0x3F..0x45` through `0x80105240`, and drives the
/// camera through `0x800F6CD0`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be a live sequence object whose `+0x60` vtable is valid.
///
/// # Confidence
/// medium - every state, constant and call shape is literal in the export and
/// the raw words; `0x80169020`/`0x801690E0` volume tests and the
/// `0x8006C500(0x284,0)` lookup are `main.dol` interfaces named by shape, and
/// `0x8042DCDC` is the external speed scale.
