/// Tests whether any live actor of the given kind overlaps a stage rectangle.
///
/// The rectangle is produced by `0x8008E890(stage, this[+0x3EE], &rect)`: its
/// four floats are `x`, `y`, `width` and `height`, so the body tests
/// `x..x+width` and `y-height..y`. It walks the `kind 2` actor chain from
/// `0x80162DB0(2, previous)` and returns `1` when the chain ends without a
/// blocker, `0` as soon as one actor is kind `3`, has no `+0x364 & 10` flag and
/// lies inside the rectangle.
///
