/// Per-frame `execute` of the `remo_lift_up` lift.
///
/// Reads the four-slot rider mask and the `0x806CFB30` flag word, keeps the
/// rider slot `+0x430` in sync with them, republishes the rider pose, drives the
/// horizontal lean `+0xE8` toward the pose-derived target and, while no rider is
