/// World-map node start-up / finish sequence.
///
/// State 0 places the node from the `W103` map object and starts the effect;
/// states 2-5 spin it through two staged ramps of `16383` halfword units;
/// state 6 spawns the two handles and the `W101` arrival gate; state 14 plays
/// the second `0x800F69F0` flourish; state 15 retires the actor.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80792a20` at `0x80792A20` (1,212 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80792a20_FUN_80792a20.c`
