/// # Safety
/// `this` must be a live map actor and the world-map globals `0x8042A18C`,
/// `0x8042A26C`, `0x8042A27C` must be initialised. The `0x80377DD4` vector must
/// hold the three runtime floats that the C negates.
///
/// # Confidence
/// medium - all states, ids and floats are literal. The C's `0x80162590` guard is
/// called twice on purpose and the state-6 sub-object argument is `+0x704`, not
/// `+0x770`; both are reproduced as written.
