/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/806149a0_FUN_806149a0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - screen object whose `+0x208` is the interface wrapper.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
