/// # Side effects
/// Writes the global course-manager cells through `0x800BBC10`/`0x800BBBD0`/
/// `0x800BBBF0`/`0x800FC190`, resets the sprite-image record with
/// `0x800E0380` and posts up to four `0x800F2A00` messages.
