/// `0x80429F7C` must hold the course manager, `0x8042A040` the sprite owner and
/// `0x8042A1A0` the object whose `+0x22C` word is the pending course; `this`
/// must be the live `0x5C7F4` forest manager.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the five message ids, the `<< 4 | slot` identifier, both RNG bounds,
/// the `count == 4`/`cell[12] == 0` gate and every call argument are literal;
/// the `divw` at `0x80772944` (outside the wave-147 decoder table) was decoded
/// by hand as `divw r0,r3,r22`.
