/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80637a40_FUN_80637a40.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - the page/state object; four records at `+0x7BC`, stride `0x3C`.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing; it is a pure leaf (no call, no global write).
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be live and all four records readable/writable.
