/// Advances the four-player result tally and the shared counter wheel.
///
/// Phase 1 claims one of the sixteen `+0x514` popup slots for each of the four
/// `+0x4E4` request rows whose kind byte is `0..3` and differs from its previous
/// kind. Phase 2 walks the four `+0x394` player records, skips empty, absent or
/// suppressed ones and any record whose score is beaten by another live record,
