///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80741010` at `0x80741010` (612 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80741010_FUN_80741010.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - the result page; requests `+0x4E4`, slots `+0x514` (also the
///   shared wheel angle), players `+0x394`, wheel latches `+0x3D8`/`+0x3D9`.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing; the body is a pure leaf.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be live and `+0x514` writable as both the slot base and the
/// `s16` angle.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - both phases, all four blocked comparisons and the three rate arms are
/// literal; `0x807CE0A0` is loaded with `lfd` and is the double `64.0`
/// (`|angle| <= 64.0`), not the `3.25f` in its first word.
