/// Loads the World-7 Koopa's BRRES and binds its six `0x38`-byte parts.
///
/// Builds the `g3d/<name>.brres` path from `+0x43C`, opens it through the NW4R
/// resource manager, binds the model holder `+0x1A4`, walks the five named part
/// slots at `+0x1E4` (names from the `+0x438` array), repeats name `0` in the
/// sixth slot at `+0x2FC`, sets each part byte from the `0x807CFA38` table,
/// re-arms each part at rate `1.0`, then runs [`fn_80789b80`] twice,
/// [`fn_80789c60`], the `+0x39C` animation wrapper and the state hand-off.
