/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80657ea0` at `0x80657EA0` (308 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80657ea0_FUN_80657ea0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
