/// Collects the world-map archive names of the four live resource groups and
/// requests the `Stage/Texture` and `Object` groups.
///
/// For every live group record it appends the four 32-byte archive names, adds
/// `"rail"` for the four `Pa3_` rail archives, walks the group's `u16` id list
/// against the `0x8031A834` name registry, and finally issues the two
/// `dres_mng` requests and hands the name object `0x80833DE8` to the `+0x74`
