/// and `0x807C_D830` (the Y one biased by `8.0` at `0x807C_D7FC`), the parameter
/// word at `0x807C_D858` and the constant Z of `0.0` (`0x807C_D80C`). The
/// parameter word is shifted into kind bits `4..27` next to the `0x30000000`
/// group and the `+0x640 == 2` flag at bit `6`, and handed to `0x80064610`
/// (effect id `0x85`). The same point then feeds sound `0x2A2` and the
/// `0x8016C890` layout effect, and finally the tail reset `0x80733EC0` runs.
