/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80733c30_FUN_80733c30.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - the burst actor; position `+0xAC..+0xB4`, table selector
///   `+0x634`, column byte `+0x348`, mode `+0x640`, effect origin `+0x60C` and
///   `+0x610`.
