/// Rebuilds one animation frame index for the four-player "player count"
/// display.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80675090` at `0x80675090` (348 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80675090_FUN_80675090.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - object with the `+0x4` flag word, the `+0xAC`/`+0xB0` position
///   pair and the `+0x3F0`/`+0x46C` animation blocks.
///
