/// or derives it from `0x800B0FD0` clamped to `0..3`. When `+0x38D <= 3` it
/// reads the player's `+0x14D4` count, converts `count + 1` to a float and
/// calls `0x800B1100` with `+0x38D + 1`. Finally it feeds that float through
/// `0x80166EF0` on `+0x46C` after `0x80169F80(0.0, +0x3F0, +0x46C)`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be live; the globals `0x8042A1C8`, `0x80429F7C` and
/// `0x80429F30` must be initialised.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the `0xFF` seed, the `(value - 1) & 0xFFFF < 4` clamp, the
/// `2^52` integer-to-float conversion and the call shapes were all read from
/// the raw words; the `extsb` before `0x8005F900` is kept.
