/// Recursively collects the unique ids of an actor subtree into a word array.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_806c97d0` at `0x806C97D0` (360 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel_d_basesNP/export/806c97d0_FUN_806c97d0.c`
///
