/// either into the group list at `+0x460` (`type == 0x19B`) or `+0x4CC`
/// (`type == 0x1A1`) following `+0xC`/`+0x6C`, or into `0x80162D00(+0x2A78)`
/// when the shape byte at `+0x38C` is `1`, or into nothing when it is `3`.
///
