/// offsets, the `+0xC`/`+0x6C` list links, the `0x38C == 1`/`== 3` arms, the
/// `+0x2A78` child handle and the `vtable+0x6C` name call all match the raw
/// words; the export's `func_0x802dcd74()`/`func_0x802dcdc0()` preamble and
/// epilogue are `_savegpr_27`/`_restgpr_27` and are not modelled, so the
/// arguments are taken from the entry registers.
