/// release attempts, the centre probe [`fn_806d1ed0`], the mount cue
/// `0x80198C30(*(0x80429D60), 0x2A6, position, 0x80069530(rider))`, the seat
/// effect [`fn_806d21a0`], `0x806D22B0(this)` and finally [`fn_806d1ef0`] unless
/// the main.dol byte `*(0x80429D48) + 0xBCB` is non-zero.
