/// - Raw words re-read at `work/rels/elf/d_basesNP.elf`: `mr r21,r3` / `mr r22,r4`
///   after the `0x802DCD58` save stub, `lis r20,0x807D`/`addi r20,r20,-0x7F00`
///   (= `0x807CE100`), `rlwinm r3,r3,12,0,19` + `oris r3,r3,0x4000`,
///   `rlwinm r0,r0,31,0,0` on the `+0x348` byte, `slw`+`rlwinm ...,0,24,31`
///   for the variant, and `cmpwi`/`cmplwi` on `r22` against `0`/`1`.
