/// along with a `16 * index` stride, the packed flags are
/// `((+0x348 & 1) << 31) | 0x40000000 | (slot << 4) | ((word & 0xFFF) << 12)`
/// and the variant is `mask & (1 << slot)`. `observed:` the two argument
/// registers come from the save-stub caller, and Ghidra's 64-bit return model
/// swaps them (`iVar1` is `r3`, `(int)uVar12` is `r4`).
