/// the normal map spin-up, plus the coin/stage progress bookkeeping.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_807b7f30` at `0x807B7F30` (396 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/807b7f30_FUN_807b7f30.c`
///
/// # Arguments
