/// Rebuilds the four `0x3C`-byte player records at `+0x7BC` from the live player
/// slots, then runs the page's five post-setup passes.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80637d20` at `0x80637D20` (400 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80637d20_FUN_80637d20.c`
///
/// The export calls `0x802DCD64` first and uses its result as the object base.
/// `0x802DCD64` is `_savegpr_23`, so the incoming `r3` survives; the raw words
/// show `mr r31,r3` straight after the call and every store is relative to
/// `r31`, so this translation restores the `this` argument.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - the page/state object; the four records from `fn_80637a40` start at
///   `+0x7BC` with stride `0x3C`; the counter table `+0x70`.
///
/// # Returns
