/// `(1.0, 0.025, 0.01, 0.001)` and state `2` up to `+0x3AC` frames with
/// `(0.0, 0.025, 0.01, 0.001)`; all three wrap back to `0`, `2` and `0`
/// respectively. Afterwards the driver `[0x80429D64]` slot `+0x2C` is cued with
/// `0x30B` and the sign-extended `1000.0 * +0x398 * +0x39C`, and `+0x394`
