/// `+0x29C`/`+0x22C`/`0x338C`/`0x16518`/`0x3394` identities match the
/// translated [`fn_8079a930`]. The `+0xEC`/`+0x10C` meanings and the
/// `+0x18C`/`+0x23C` flag roles are `// inferred:` from the `1,1,0` arguments
