/// Places the player at a position, broadcasts it to the `+0x184` chain and
/// restarts the course state.
///
/// Every node of the `+0x184` list is re-placed through [`fn_8077d230`]; then
/// the three position words and the three `+0x264` shadow words are written
/// from `position`, the `+0x1FC` target block from `listener`, and the state is
/// reset with `0x80799960(this, 4, -1)`. The `+0x1D0` config bytes `+0x151` and
/// `+0x152` are published through `0x80104FD0`. Finally mode `6` spawns effect
/// `60` at `1.9x` scale and mode `7` spawns effect `190` at `1.9x` after an
/// optional `0x80799960(this, 2, -1)` demotion plus a `±1.0/0.0` offset table
/// selected by `0x800FC040`.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8079e030` at `0x8079E030` (432 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/8079e030_FUN_8079e030.c`
