/// `0x8`/`0x4`. When the two angle words `+0x66C` and `+0x660` differ, `+0x6A8`
/// is refreshed from `0x807C1130(this)`, and the `0x807C08B0(this, 0xF)`
/// classification byte is published to `[0x80834470] + 0x4FC`.
