/// Runs one frame of the pendulum actor's pivot update.
///
/// `0x80682F40(this)` (the channel recompute) and `0x806830D0(this)` run first.
/// Then the signed step `+0xAB2` is added to the yaw `+0x104` and to the three
/// halves `+0xAB4/+0xAB6/+0xAB8` when the direction byte `+0x348` is clear, and
/// subtracted when it is set. Both controllers are re-placed: the `+0x92C` node
/// takes the `400.0`/`0.0` box through `0x800DB7D0` with the angle
/// `16099 + yaw`, then its slots `+0x0C` and `+0x10` run; the three `0x3D4` and
/// three `0x680` `0xE4`-byte blocks are flushed through `0x8007FDA0`. When
/// `+0xAA8` is set, each non-zero channel float `+0xABC + i*4` is pushed into
/// the live player of slot `i` through `0x80057820`.
