/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel_d_basesNP/export/80683200_FUN_80683200.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - pendulum actor; direction `+0x348`, yaw `+0x104`, step `+0xAB2`,
///   three halves `+0xAB4..+0xAB8`, node `+0x92C`, blocks `+0x3D4`/`+0x680`,
///   flag `+0xAA8`, channels `+0xABC`.
