/// per run, the `16099` (`0x3EE3`) angle base, the `24.0`/`-16.0`/`0.0`
/// position pair and the `4`-element channel loop are literal. The
/// `psq_l`/`psq_st` pair is the plain `f32` spill of `f31` under GQR0 and the
/// `ldexpf` guards are compiler noise. The three register copies that feed
/// `0x800DB7D0` are `fneg f3,f1`, `fmr f4,f2`, `fmr f5,f3` (`0xFC600850`,
/// `0xFC801090`, `0xFCA01890`), i.e. `(400.0, 0.0, -400.0, 0.0, -400.0)`.
