/// Consumes the head of the 40-entry pending-effect queue and spawns the actor
/// it describes.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80651a60` at `0x80651A60` (452 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80651a60_FUN_80651a60.c`
///
/// # Arguments
