/// returns true, the head entry's two words are packed into a 12-byte
/// descriptor and the 40-entry table at `0x80828438` is compacted, its last
/// entry marked with two `-1` words and the count decremented. Then
/// `0x806514D0` builds the actor and `0x80651830` binds its sprite.
