/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_806f0f20` at `0x806F0F20` (496 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/806f0f20_FUN_806f0f20.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - layout owner; pane manager `+0x3F0`, lane byte `+0x348`, camera
///   origin `+0xAC/+0xB0`.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes seven floats: `+0x700`, `+0x704`, `+0x708`, `+0x70C`, `+0x710`,
/// `+0x714` and the four-entry array at `+0x718`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this + 0x3F0` must be a live layout and panes `1..=5` must exist; the
/// 52-byte transform block passed to `0x8016F130`/`0x801C1160` must not exceed
/// the caller's frame.
