/// medium - every offset, table entry and call is verified against the raw
/// words (`0x807CC0A8 = -8.0`, `+4 = 8.0`, `+8 = 12.0`, `+12 = 20.0`,
/// `0x807CC0B0 = 12.0`, `0x807CC0B4 = 20.0`, `0x807CC0B8 = 0.5`,
/// `0x807CC088 = 0.0`); the per-field roles (camera-relative X/Y, pane ids)
/// are `// inferred:` from the transform calls and are not named by the REL.
