/// Spawns the four `Wm_jr_electricstart` effects and binds the spine animation.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_807003c0` at `0x8070_03C0` (492 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/807003c0_FUN_807003c0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - the `boss_koopaJr` actor; position `+0xAC..+0xB4`, character byte
///   `+0x348`, resource `+0x540`, four part objects `+0x544 + i*0x40`, part
///   buffer `+0x8C4`. Ghidra drops the `r3` parameter because it mistakes the
///   `0x802DCD6C` save helper for a call that returns it.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Emits four `Wm_jr_electricstart` effects spread symmetrically from
/// `y - 104.0` to `y + 104.0` (x shifted by the character byte times `13.5`),
/// with the third halfword flag set to `0x7FFF` when that byte is `1`; then
/// resolves `boss_koopaJr_toge` on `+0x540` and binds it into each of the four
/// part objects through their virtual `+0x18`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be live, the character table at `0x8042C1A0` must be filled, and
/// each `+0x544 + i*0x40` object must expose a valid vtable.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the `psq_st`/`psq_l` pairs at `0x807003D4..0x807003EC` and
/// `0x80700578..0x80700590` are GQR0 scalar saves of `f28`..`f31` (the `r1`
/// slots `0x50..0x88`), so no GQR model is needed. Every constant is read out
/// of the REL: `0x807CC4D0 = 8.0`, `0x807CC4D4 = 112.0`, `0x807CC4D8 = 208.0`,
/// `0x807CC4AC = 13.5`, `0x807CC4C0 = 1.0`, and the magic
/// `0x807CC4B8 = 4503601774854144.0 (2^52 + 2^31)` used with `xoris` for the
/// three integer-to-float conversions (`3`, the loop index and the character
/// byte). The strings are `0x80803A5C` = `boss_koopaJr_toge` and `0x80803A70` =
/// `Wm_jr_electricstart`.
