/// `0.0`, mode `1` ramps it from `0x80805DE8` up to `0x808063B8` (180) frames,
/// mode `2` holds it at `1.0` and any other mode ramps it back down from
/// `0x808063BC` (90) frames to `0x80805DEC`. All four arms use the exported
/// ratio helper `0x806601B0`, which returns `(counter - from) / (to - from)`
