/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/8063a560_FUN_8063a560.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// None.
///
/// # Returns
/// `1` when the scene query succeeds, the pad scan returns `0` and the
/// `0x80600510` probe returns `0`; `0` otherwise.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Reads the scene, controller and screen-probe state only.
///
/// # Safety
/// The main.dol scene and controller managers must be live.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the two guards, the `-1` scan argument and the
/// `cntlzw`/`rlwinm r3,r0,27,5,31` fold are literal; the fold is `1` only for a
/// zero probe value (identical in shape to `fn_80623260`).
