/// `{0, -1, 0x8064_B6C0}`, `{0, -1, 0x8064_B6F0}`, `{0, -1, 0x8064_B720}` and
/// `{0, -1, 0x8064_B750}`; the dispatch below reproduces `0x802D_CBFC`
/// (negative index = literal function address).
