/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80673600_FUN_80673600.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - object whose float field `+0xE8` is the multiplier.
///
/// # Returns
/// `(i16)(-(i32)(x * (x - 176.0f)))`, sign-extended to `i32` by `extsh`.
///
