///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80696e00` at `0x80696E00` (124 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80696e00_FUN_80696e00.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - actor; collision block `+0x1EC`, probe object `+0x2DC`, flags
///   `+0x274` and flag byte `+0x443`.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
