/// Advances the two-phase alternating timer used by the `+0x394` object.
///
/// Phase `0` counts `+0x394` down; when it reaches zero the timer reloads
/// `+0x398` with `0x78` and switches to phase `1`. Phase `1` counts `+0x398`
