/// - Ghidra: `FUN_806ff390` at `0x806F_F390` (96 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/806ff390_FUN_806ff390.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - owner; phase `+0x39C`, counters `+0x394`/`+0x398`.
