/// stride and the final `lwz r0,0x8a0(r3)` are literal; the terminal
/// `b 0x80195380` is the sound queue already used by `fn_806376e0` and
/// `fn_80602db0` (Ghidra's `halt_baddata` is only the unmodelled tail call).
