/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8064a820` at `0x8064A820` (180 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel_d_basesNP/export/8064a820_FUN_8064a820.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - the claiming object; gate word `+0x764`.
///
