/// busy owner keeps it.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes `[0x80429D40] + 0x20` when the claim succeeds.
///
/// # Safety
/// `0x80429D40` must hold a live object and `this` must be readable at `+0x764`.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - Ghidra's `param_1[0x1d9]` is the raw `lwz 0x764(r3)`, the three-way
/// split is the `cmpi`/`cmp`/`bc 12,2` chain at `0x8064a844..0x8064a860`, and
/// the early `li r3,0` exit is the only `return false`.
