/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel_d_basesNP/export/80656eb0_FUN_80656eb0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `record` - this contact record; `+4` is the owner actor.
/// * `entry` - the other contact record; `+4` is the other actor.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Calls the other actor's receiver, the owner's `+0x6C` name getter and
/// `0x8069EA30`.
