/// `0x80169F80` speed from `0x807C8988` (`0.0`) and the `0x801680E0` rate from
/// `0x807C8998` (`1.0`). Then `+0xE8`, `+0xEC`, `+0xF0` become `0.0`, `+0x114`
/// becomes `-0.15` (`0x807C8928`), `+0x5F4` is cleared and `+0x500` set to `800`.
