/// Kills the actor when no player carries the same variant byte.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8067ecc0` at `0x8067ECC0` (188 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/8067ecc0_FUN_8067ecc0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - actor killed through `0x80064D10(this, 0)` on mismatch.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
