/// `true` when the virtual returned a record, `false` when it returned null.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Calls virtual `+0x1C` of the `+0x4D4` interface and writes the 0x14-byte
/// record it returns.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be live and the `+0x4D4` interface must be initialised.
