/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80697d00` at `0x80697D00` (184 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80697d00_FUN_80697d00.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - query object passed through to `0x80697DC0`; it reads its own
///   position at `+0xE8`/`+0xEC`/`+0xF0`.
