/// `1` on the first match, `0` when the `0x12B` chain is exhausted.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Walks the `0x80162D50` chain 299 (`0x12B`). Per candidate it reads
/// `+0xAC`/`+0xB0`/`+0xB4`, subtracts the candidate's own `+0x314` radius from
/// the y component and calls `0x80697DC0(this, point, candidate + 0xE8)`.
///
/// # Safety
/// The actor list must be initialised and every candidate live.
