/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/807316f0_FUN_807316f0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - pipe object; row index `+0x9EC`, latched byte `+0xA04`.
/// * `rider` - player actor; state `+0x38C`, vtable at `+0x60`.
