/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes `+0x63C`, may run a burst builder, and calls virtual slot `+0x18` of
/// `+0x394` with `0x80830EA0`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be live and `+0x394` must hold a valid interface object.
///
/// # Confidence
