/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/807bfb20_FUN_807bfb20.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - the ride actor; state `+0x608`, previous position
///   `+0x4B0..+0x4B8`, current position `+0x4BC..+0x4C4`, pending step
///   `+0x5F8..+0x600`.
