/// Repeats the scene tag probe until it succeeds or the record's count runs out.
///
/// Resolves the active stage record `scene + scene[+0x338C] * 0x16518` from the
/// scene singleton `0x8042A18C` and calls `0x807C09B0` at most
/// `record[+0x33A0]` times, returning `1` at the first non-zero result and `0`
/// once the counter reaches the bound. `0x807C09B0` loads its own scene name and
/// the four-entry tag table at `0x8082152C`, and overwrites `r3`/`r4` before
/// using them (`lis r3,0x1` at `0x807C09C8`), so the two forwarded arguments are
/// dead at the call but are still passed to match the C.
