/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_807c0a80` at `0x807C_0A80` (152 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/807c0a80_FUN_807c0a80.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - forwarded unchanged to `0x807C09B0`.
///
/// # Returns
/// `1` as soon as `0x807C09B0` returns non-zero, otherwise `0`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Up to `record[+0x33A0]` calls to `0x807C09B0`; no stores of its own.
///
/// # Safety
/// `0x8042A18C` must hold the live scene manager and its `+0x338C` index must
/// select a live record.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the `lis 0x1`/`addi 0x6518` stride product, the `+0x33A0` bound and
/// the unsigned `blt` back edge at `0x807C0AF0` are literal; the dead arguments
/// are proven from the callee's first six words.
