/// from `0x80821598..0x808215A0`, the `r3` output pointer `+0x6FC` and the
/// `fcmpu`/`bne` pair at `0x807C10F0` are literal; the reset word is
/// `0x807D0A6C` (= `0.0`), copied as a raw float load/store.
