/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel_d_basesNP/export/80691d20_FUN_80691d20.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - actor with the three phase accumulators at `+0x500`, `+0x502`,
///   `+0x504` and the three result halfwords at `+0x100`, `+0x102`, `+0x104`.
///
