/// # Safety
/// `this` must be live and `0x80237BD0` callable.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - `lha`/`addi`/`sth` wrap the phase in 16 bits, the `psq_l` lanes are
/// the `GQR3` unsigned-16-bit form, the `fctiwz` truncation is explicit in the
/// raw words, and the constants `1/256`, `700`, `1024` and `256` are read from
/// the ELF.
