///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - object with the tracked position `+0xAC`, window `+0x778`
///   (array) and `+0x77C`, output `+0x768`, companion word `+0x76C`, selector
///   byte `+0x348`, and the actor vtable at `+0x60`.
///
