/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel_d_basesNP/export/80698090_FUN_80698090.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - actor with the `+0x60` vtable, velocity `+0xE8`/`+0xEC` and the
///   `+0xD28` flag.
/// * `target` - pointer to two `f32` values (read at `+0` and `+4`).
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
