/// `this`, the `+0x2DC` result, and `*(owner + 0x5F8)` must be live; `target`
/// must be readable for eight bytes.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - `lfs`/`fdivs`/`stfs` prove the two `f32` divisions are single
/// precision; the slot offsets `0x35C`, `0x2DC`, `0x37C`, `0x5F8`, `0xC` and
/// `0x10` and the `bne` short-circuit are literal.
