/// Builds the model, the animation bindings and the collision adapter of a
/// variant actor.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_806c13b0` at `0x806C13B0` (232 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/806c13b0_FUN_806c13b0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
