/// `+0x318..+0x324`, the variant byte at `+0x526`, calls `0x800D2610` with nine
/// arguments and binds `+0x3BC` to `+0x394` through `0x8016A000`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be a live actor with the render/collision sub-objects at
/// `+0x394`, `+0x3FC`, `+0x43C` and `+0x4C4` initialised.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the variant clamp, every float seed
/// (`0x807CAF74` = 512.0, `0x807CAF8C` = 256.0, `0x807CAF68` = 0.0,
/// `0x807CAF88` = -128.0), the `+0x526` byte table `0x807CAF80 = [8,12,16,0]`
/// and all nine argument registers of `0x800D2610` were re-read from the raw
/// words.
