/// `0x8005F900`/`0x80070CB0`.
///
/// # Safety
/// The player manager and the scene pointer at `0x80429E00` must be live.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the mask scan (`lbz 0x80429CA8`, `and.`, `rlwinm ...,1,24,30`), the
/// `fcmpo f30,f31` first-sample branch and the folded `<=` minimum test were
/// re-read from the raw words. `0x802DCD70`/`0x802DCDBC` are save/restore
/// fragments, not semantic calls.
