///   `+0x65C`.
/// * `flag` - `1` for the rider-driven path, any other value for the fallback
///   path.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// May write `+0xB0` (through [`fn_806d02a0`]), `+0x640` and `+0x65C`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be live and the scene band readable.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the two `bc` gates, the |Δ| < `0x807CB46C` (160.0) early return, the
/// `0x807CB4A0` (18.0) step and both phase assignments were re-read from the
/// raw words.
