/// # Confidence
/// medium - the gate, the vector, the normaliser and both branches are literal
/// raw words; `0x802BE4A0` is used as `sinf` here exactly as in the translated
/// `0x807890xx` window body (`// inferred:`), and the strictness of the two
/// window comparisons follows the export (`dy <= low || high <= dy`).
