/// Recomputes the signed angle step `+0x3D0` and advances `+0x104` by it.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80707800` at `0x8070_7800` (224 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x8060_0000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/80707800_FUN_80707800.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - actor: input masks `+0x358`/`+0x35C`, direction `+0x3E1`,
///   amplitude `+0x3D8`, step `+0x3D0`, current angle `+0x104`.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes `+0x3D0` and `+0x104`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be live; the input-mask pointer at `0x8042_A078` must be
/// initialised.
///
/// # Confidence
