/// `+0xAC..+0x4F2`.
///
/// # Confidence
/// medium - the arithmetic, the two offsets and `0x807CD644` (`0.00390625`)
/// are literal; the circular-placement reading and the sine/cosine identity are
/// `// inferred:` (same helper pair as the translated [`fn_80734e30`]).
