/// the loop bound is `cmpi cr0,31,r31,4` + `bc 12,0`, the skip test is
/// `fcmpu` against `0.0` from `0x807CD8D0`, and the `r30 += 4` pointer advance
/// gives the `+0x524 + i*4` stride.
