/// at `0x8031D3A0`, `-7.0` at `0x8031D3A8`, `-20.0` at `0x8031D3AC`, `0.5` at
/// `0x807D01BC` and `-0.5` at `0x807D01C0` were read from the images. Mode `0`
/// stores the bias constant (not the product) at `+0x118`, as the raw `stfs r2`
/// shows. Signature used by `FUN_80799200`: `fn_80798e20(this: usize, mode: i32)`.
