/// `left <= x`, `x < left + width + shift`, `y < top` and
/// `top - height <= y`; `0x807CE598 = 0.0`, `0x807CE5E4 = 160.0` and the
/// `+0x4 & 0xF == 1` guard are literal. The twin `fn_8074b770` uses the same
/// rectangle shape. The dead `lfs`/`stfs` spill block at `0x8074A524..0x8074A55C`
/// (globals `0x80429E00+0x38..0x44`) is compiler residue and is omitted.
