/// For every live player slot it takes the level `+0x3EC` minus the player's
/// `+0xAC`, folds the delta to its absolute value, scales it by `2.4 / 64.0`,
/// clamps it up to `1.0`, and hands it to `0x80052080` alongside the level.
/// The routine returns `1` only when every published value stayed `1.0`.
