/// Advances the two-phase tilt halfwords from the shared scale record.
///
/// Looks up list `0x79` and takes `+0x394` as the scale (0.0 when absent).
/// `+0x524` accumulates `8192 * scale` with a `1024` rounding bias, and
/// `+0x104` becomes `16384 * scale + (4096 * scale +/- 512) *
/// sin(trunc(step) * 1/256)`.
