/// landing path.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the call sites (`0x806D09B0`, and `call_f32_u32x2` in this file)
/// prove the `(f32, r3, r4)` argument order, the `(idx & 0xFF)`-scaled
/// `0x807CB490`/`0x807CB498` tables, `0x807CB49C` = 64.0 and the `cror 2,1,2`
/// fold `height >= target - 64.0` for the settle path. `0x806CFED0` returns
