/// `0x801C0BD0`, applies the angles with `0x8016EF50`, copies `+0x7C`/`+0xDC`
/// into `+0x1A0` (`0x8016A170`/`0x8016A150`/`0x8016A1A0`) and runs
/// `0x800F6810` with `(0.0, 1.0, 1.0, 1.0)`.
