///   `+0x1FC/+0x200/+0x204`; three self-copies into `+0x264/+0x268/+0x26C`;
///   `li r0,18` + `stw r0,0x2E0(r3)`; `bl 0x80100B40` on `+0x22C` and the
///   `0x80104FD0`/`0x80105060` effect pair with kind `4`.
