/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_807ba440` at `0x807B_A440` (204 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/807ba440_FUN_807ba440.c`
