/// `0x800DF180`, binds `cobHatenaSwitch` into the model adapter at `+0x1A4`
/// (slot `0x18` of its vtable), builds the animation object at `+0x1E8`
/// (`0x224`-byte record) and the frame object at `+0x1B0`, then releases the
/// temporary accessor.
