/// - Ghidra: `FUN_807826b0` at `0x807826B0` (516 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80600000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_basesNP/export/807826b0_FUN_807826b0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - live `daHatenaSwitch_c`-family actor; the accessor is built at
