/// `0x80429F7C`, the HUD/transition record `0x80429C30`, the globals
/// `0x8042A19E`/`0x8042A1xx`/`0x8081A554`/`0x8042873C`, and calls the virtual
/// slots `+0x64`/`+0x68` of `this+0x60` plus the `0x8078E6xx..0x8078F3xx`
/// helpers.
